 round is seeded and replayable. Daily seeds are fixed per UTC day and identical for everyone.":"每一轮都是种子且可重玩的。每日种子在每个 UTC 日都是固定的，并且对每个人来说都是相同的。","Any Line":"任何一行","Complete any row, column, or diagonal.":"完成任意一行、一列或一条对角线。","Two Lines":"两条线","Complete any two different lines.":"完成任意两条不同的线。","Diagonal":"对角线","Complete either main diagonal.":"完成任意一条主对角线。","Four Corners":"四角","Mark all four corners of the card.":"标记卡片的所有四个角。","Lantern Frame":"灯笼框架","Mark every cell on the outer edge.":"标记外边缘的每个单元格。","Crossed Light":"交叉光","Complete both diagonals (an X).":"完成两条对角线（形成一个 X）。","Mark every cell on the card.":"标记卡上的每个单元格。","Marking a Call":"标记呼叫","Numbers are called one at a time. A glowing ball shows the current call.":"一次呼叫一个号码。发光球显示当前通话。","If the called number is on your card, tap it to mark it. Mark the glowing cell now.":"如果被叫号码在您的卡上，请点击它进行标记。现在标记发光的单元格。","Lines and Claims":"线路和索赔","Five marked cells in a row, column, or diagonal complete a line.":"行、列或对角线上的五个标记单元格构成一条线。","Keep marking called numbers until a line is complete.":"继续标记被叫号码，直到一行完成。","A line is complete! Press CLAIM to win the round before anyone else.":"一条线完成了！在其他人之前按CLAIM赢得这一轮。","Target Patterns":"目标模式","Some rounds need a special pattern. This one needs the FOUR CORNERS.":"有些回合需要特殊图案。这个需要四个角。","Mark corner numbers as they are called, then claim. Corners glow faintly to guide you.":"标记角球号码，然后认领。角落会发出微弱的光芒来引导你。","Speed Lantern":"速度灯笼","Win in 38 calls or fewer.":"在 38 次或更少的通话中获胜。","Iron Frame":"铁架","Complete the outer frame.":"完成外框。","Steady Hand":"稳定之手","Win with zero invalid actions.":"以零无效动作获胜。","Full Glow":"全发光","Black out the entire card.":"涂黑整个卡片。","tap":"点击","number called":"被叫号码","marked":"标记","not allowed":"不允许","line complete":"线路完成","bingo! round won":"宾果游戏！回合获胜","round lost":"回合失败","round begins":"回合开始","achievement unlocked":"成就已解锁","Hosted hall — waiting for the round to start.":"主办大厅——等待回合开始。","Volumes, mute, graphics quality, language, reduced motion, high contrast and text size are in the StarHermit Options.":"音量、静音、画质、语言、减少动态效果、高对比度和文字大小位于 StarHermit 选项中。","Open Options":"打开选项","Change keys and buttons":"更改按键和按钮","Arrow keys move between cells, {mark} marks ({call} marks a focused cell, otherwise calls), {claim} claim, {undo} undo in Practice, {hint} hint, {pause} pause, {camera} reset camera, {back} back.":"方向键在格子间移动，{mark} 标记（{call} 标记聚焦的格子，否则呼叫），{claim} 认领，{undo} 练习中撤销，{hint} 提示，{pause} 暂停，{camera} 重置镜头，{back} 返回。","{n} of {max} seats taken — empty seats play as lanterns.":"{n} 或 {max} 座位已被占用 — 空座位充当灯笼。","Start round":"开始回合","Waiting for the host to start the round…":"等待主持人开始回合……","Playing as {name}":"正在以 {name} 身份游戏"}
